<title>USA: Penn Treaty American raises number of shrs.</title>
<headline>Penn Treaty American raises number of shrs.</headline>
<dateline>ALLENTOWN, Pa. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Penn Treaty American Corp voted at a January 28 meeting to increase the number of authorized shares of common stock from 10,000,000 shares to 25,000,000, the company said Thursday in a prepared release.</p>
<p>(( New York Newsdesk, 212 859-1610))</p>
